        "ggJ2W_87EDS_text": "<p>Here at Wellness Nest, we want you to feel absolutely confident trying our product—or we’ll refund 100% of your investment. We’re so certain you’ll see a real change in your menopause symptoms, hot flashes, mood, and weight management that we bear all the risk.</p>",
