        "ggZq6j08-Ym_text": "<p>With up to three full months to experience MenoMate, you’ll have plenty of time to see real improvements—from fewer hot flashes and better sleep to a flatter midsection. If you’re not completely satisfied, just reach out for a fast, no-questions-asked refund. We want your only surprise to be how quickly you feel like yourself again.</p>",
        "ggiR4o5XLaN_text": "Your Purchase Is Protected"
