        "ggOG9NPMaMu_text": "<p>You deserve absolute peace of mind—and a clear path to relief. Here’s our promise:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Try a Full 90‑Day Supply of the Ultimate Relief Bundle (3 bottles).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Experience the Difference: If at any point in those 90 days you’re not waking up pain‑free every morning, simply email us at support@wellnessnest.co with “REFUND” in the subject line.</p><p>Get Every Penny Back—no forms to fill out, no hoops to jump through.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lock in Your Relief and Savings Today: There’s zero risk, only the chance to reclaim restful sleep and pain‑free mornings. Don’t wait—our rare ingredients mean this batch won’t last, and your 90‑day trial starts with your very first shipment.</p>",
        "gguTiwYRPbv_text": "<strong>Your </strong><span style=\"color:#9128B4;\"><strong>90‑Day “Wake Pain‑Free”</strong></span><strong> Risk‑Free Trial</strong>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727339561795"
