    "gp_section_583937727339627331": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "6f57313d3e68995468a9fb8fe66e08d6b5a8705adcc454411635e2fbaddb86e3_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg3SMhf__yf_text": "<p>Pain pills</p>",
        "ggF5wCjhaC1_text": "<p>Changing hormones trigger inflammation that attacks your joints directly. This isn't normal aging - it's a specific hormone problem!</p>",
        "ggGB1-MA-um_text": "<p>You deserve better than temporary fixes. You deserve a solution that rebuilds what menopause stole—so you can reclaim restful nights and pain‑free days.</p>",
        "ggKGIYnZ52z_text": "<p>Physical therapy</p>",
        "ggKvNa3FYEx_text": "<p>Chronic Inflammation</p>",
        "ggOtEfUvvE4_text": "Here’s What Menopause Is Doing to Your Body Right Now (You’re Not Alone)",
        "ggPv2AnvxIu_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "ggQct6zdn50_text": "<p>You deserve answers—not just pain pills. You’re not alone: countless women over 45 have been told “it’s just arthritis”, only to feel dismissed and stuck.</p>",
        "ggSwdyJ7cES_text": "<p>&nbsp;Menopause disrupts gut health, triggering gut‑based inflammation that circulates back to your joints—feeding your pain in a vicious cycle.</p>",
        "ggbVjcPSdU8_text": "<p>Every drop in estrogen steals away the collagen “cushion” around your hip tendons—leaving raw fibers that scream with every movement.</p>",
        "ggcZ2Bet_VD_text": "<p>Gut‑Inflammation Feedback Loop</p>",
        "ggcrY1IxowG_text": "Every Treatment So Far Has Fallen Short",
        "gghM8EJP2fX_text": "<p>🔒 90‑Day “Wake‑Up Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>",
        "gghlzTB07Mi_text": "<p>You haven’t done anything wrong. This isn’t a failing on your part—it’s how menopause rewires your body. Traditional fixes miss these root causes, leaving you feeling hopeless, exhausted, and gaslit.</p>",
        "ggjVOoumCC9_text": "<p>Hormone Replacement Therapy</p>",
        "ggoLwXzFw2A_text": "<p>Estrogen Decline</p>",
        "ggsnSa36f9X_text": "<p>Hormonal Collagen Depletion</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727339627331"
    },
    "gp_section_583937727339692867": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "5212d10e18b8910bdd53e57827711ea403c6fef463de09bbb36a2b72f92a47d3_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggHy88lHdJ-_text": "<p><strong>MenoMate™ is 3rd-party lab tested and verified for safety and potency.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>✅ Free from harmful bacteria like E. coli and Salmonella<br>✅ Passed all purity checks – no contaminants or adulterants<br>✅ Key ingredients like <strong>DIM (62.7 mg)</strong> and <strong>Prebiotics (322 mg)</strong> match or exceed label claims<br>✅ Made in a GMP-certified facility and approved for Amazon compliance</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>In short:</strong> MenoMate™ is clean, potent, and safe to take daily — exactly what your body deserves during menopause.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727339692867"
    },
    "gp_section_583937727339758403": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "5166ca72b99053c4f88dc7fb996bbbee750762789786055c9c908e86c2bb6ceb_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg2PxuidWfE_text": "<p>Gluteal<br>Tendinopathy</p>",
        "ggBT8e6mdxm_text": "<p>Deep joint/groin pain</p>",
        "ggCNe_LDLOV_text": "<p>You're jolted awake at 3AM by sharp hip pain. You can barely get through the day without wincing.</p><p>Your doctor may have said, \"It's arthritis,\" or, \"It's normal for your age.\"</p><p>And that advice isn't wrong. Wear-and-tear and time both play a part.</p><p>But there's a deeper problem most doctors miss. This is especially true for women 45+. It's called gluteal tendinopathy, also known as Menopausal Hip Syndrome.</p>",
        "ggFbtj7XPFV_text": "<p>Worst after&nbsp;<br>getting up after sitting</p>",
        "ggINWXTVeY-_text": "<p>💬 Sound familiar?</p>",
        "ggW0eZDFyo7_text": "<p>Outer hip pain</p>",
        "ggYTZFNPqQw_text": "<p>Common in menopausal women 45-63</p>",
        "gg_cSgY_aOy_text": "<p>If so, you’re not imagining it—and you’re not alone. Traditional arthritis treatments may soothe symptoms, but they won’t heal the hormone‑linked tendon damage at the root of your nightly agony.</p>",
        "ggb6Q1seX84_text": "<p>Hurts most when side-sleeping at night</p>",
        "ggiEfTnnDeW_text": "Still Being Told “It’s Just Arthritis” or “Normal Aging”?",
        "ggof5XRuCFe_text": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Arthritis</p>",
        "ggrj2BuzB63_text": "<p>Men and women&nbsp;</p><p>equally, usually 60+</p>",
        "ggsZkAs3w1m_text": "<p>Often can’t cross your legs, &nbsp;the hip just won’t move that way.</p>",
        "ggvcHSr18fG_text": "Arthritis vs. Gluteal Tendinopathy: Which One Feels Like Your Pain?",
        "ggxUwu3yFSV_text": "<p>Sharp outer hip pain when standing on one leg for 30 seconds</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727339758403"
    },
