        "gg_frz7_suX_text": "<p><strong>Less nighttime tossing and turning</strong> as inflammation calms—finally drift off without dreading each turn.</p>",
        "ggaCWICkEnO_text": "Week 5–8",
        "ggh3nEUGl3B_text": "Month 1:",
        "ggkZOb539ZU_text": "<strong>Exactly When You’ll Feel Relief with MenoMate™</strong>",
        "ggm6KMATGna_text": "<p>Unlike temporary fixes that mask symptoms, MenoMate™ addresses the <strong>hormonal root cause</strong> behind gluteal tendinopathy—so your relief builds and lasts. Thousands of women over 50 have already felt meaningful improvement within 3 months. <strong>You deserve this relief, too.</strong></p>",
