    "gp_section_583937727339955011": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "77a190c748439f3ba6b80f381467ca3ec4d1c709b07bb6ccf9cb7ea881e2bc66_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gg1EEylVD2r_text": "<strong>Why Leading Menopause Specialists Now Recommend MenoMate</strong>",
        "gg67UMMwbjk_text": "<strong>Why MenoMate™ vs. Everything Else:</strong>",
        "ggE0nP62TW8_text": "<p>🔒 90‑Day “Wake‑Up Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>",
        "ggKO764fqEo_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "ggX9cpylkk9_text": "<p>MenoMate</p>",
        "ggaUDRPxbpp_text": "<p>❌ Only mask pain temporarily<br>❌ Weak, generic doses<br>❌ Single‑ingredient fixes<br>❌ Generic joint supplements</p><p>❌ No confidence in results</p>",
        "ggdOyGHt6ge_text": "<p>Traditional Method</p>",
        "gggUuiARdfW_text": "<p>Finally, we have a targeted solution for menopausal hip pain. MenoMate™ directly addresses the hormonal collagen loss that causes gluteal tendinopathy—exactly what we’ve been missing.</p>",
        "ggiWlVYIH1o_text": "<p>Dr. Claire Thompson,&nbsp;</p><p>Women’s Health Specialist, 20+ years</p>",
        "ggk__M38Rj5_text": "<p>Rachel Nguyen -&nbsp;</p><p>BSc-Lead Nutrition Scientist</p>",
        "ggtlCKk-zWC_text": "<p>✅️ Targets hormonal root cause<br>✅ Clinical‑strength, research‑backed</p><p>✅️ 3‑Axis hormone + inflammation + gut</p><p>✅️ Designed for menopause<br>✅️ 90‑Day “Wake Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>",
        "ggzNZxv6v3s_text": "<p>The 3‑Axis approach makes perfect sense. You can’t rebuild collagen if hormones are off, inflammation is raging, and your gut can’t absorb nutrients. This is comprehensive care in a capsule.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727339955011"
    },
    "gp_section_583937727340020547": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "0b7382d9668156017d58e63b7d52dc69fe283403573075a0deff17a800a66409_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggJ3QZAatPA_text": "<p>Ships in larger, cost‑efficient batches, so we can offer you a $90 off.</p>",
        "ggKesTRaRmK_text": "<p>Lets you secure long‑term relief without missing a single dose.</p>",
        "ggNlwCKGNID_text": "<p>Guarantees you a steady supply before we pause sales for a new harvest.</p>",
        "ggTrLahyVo0_text": "<p>🔒 90‑Day “Wake‑Up Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>",
        "ggWc-PuuTdA_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#A11BAD;\"><strong>Plus FREE Bonus</strong></span><strong>: Menopause Recovery Kit ($419 Value)</strong></p><p>Why you need both: Your supplement can only work if your gut absorbs it. This dietitian-approved plan maximizes MenoMate™'s effectiveness.</p><p>✅ Boosts collagen absorption with Vitamin C-rich recipes&nbsp;</p><p>✅ Reduces inflammation for faster tendon healing&nbsp;</p><p>✅ Supports gut health for better nutrient uptake</p><p><i>Customers who follow the meal plan report 40% faster mobility improvement.</i></p><p>MenoMate™ + Menopause Recovery Kit = Complete hormonal healing.</p>",
        "ggmw0s7oYMO_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "ggues5naWrc_text": "<strong>Save </strong><span style=\"color:#9128B4;\"><strong>$90 + FREE Shipping + FREE GIFT</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>With Our 3-Bottle Bundle</strong>",
        "gqkWtmqeEUwsT_text": "<p>You deserve lasting relief—and to lock in your supply before this precious formula vanishes. Here’s the real reason behind our steep bundle discount:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>“MenoMate™ is crafted from ingredients so rare and time‑sensitive that we face inevitable stock gaps.”</p><p>➢ Wild‑harvested Black Cohosh only grows in remote North American forests—and only for a few weeks each year.</p><p>➢ Organic Turmeric comes from small, sustainable farms. It takes 7 months to mature, harvest, and cure for peak potency.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We planned carefully, but overwhelming demand has depleted our reserves faster than expected.</p><p>That means, once this batch is gone, it may be months—or even until next year—before we can sell MenoMate™ again.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727340020547"
    },
