    "gp_section_583937727340151619": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "a1bbf9b83507e9d2acb4ff0d70c6077d48f463aa60c4102e6e5f9433c37cf089_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gTSVppQVRPihz_text": "<p>My friend said Meno-Mate was the only thing that helped her move like a human again. After taking it daily, I wasn't limping anymore—walking, climbing stairs, pain-free. I finally felt like my body was mine again.</p>",
        "gdibeONFxMzze_text": "Verified buyer",
        "gg2LGafJcso_text": "Verified buyer",
        "gg3FQ0qWAOJ_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\">But you don’t have to settle for endless pain.</span></p>",
        "ggBfSRtuE_b_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggEHp_NgLHL_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "ggMdwDsvGD4_text": "What makes these women different from you?",
        "ggOCh3t-eUS_text": "<p>Angela, 62</p>",
        "ggOXZ_t407O_text": "<p>🔒 90‑Day “Wake‑Up Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>",
        "ggQD1otzcjp_text": "<p>Michelle, 58</p>",
        "gggv7q-P0QE_text": "Your Turn to Reclaim <span style=\"color:#9128B4;\">Pain‑Free Nights</span>",
        "ggmxzp_K7NS_text": "<p>Nothing.</p><p>You’ve tried the same things they did—doctors, pain pills, physical therapy—and still felt stuck, powerless, like you’d have to “live with it.” You haven’t done anything wrong. This is just how menopause affects your body.&nbsp;</p>",
        "giPpISqNpXyua_text": "<p>My doctor couldn't explain my excruciating hip pain at 44. Turns out it was menopause. Four years of non-stop aching, barely able to stand. Painkillers and shots failed. Meno-Mate changed everything—joints relaxed, sleeping better.\"</p>",
        "gkzvDKVxbbZMn_text": "<p>My friend said Meno-Mate was the only thing that helped her move like a human again. After taking it daily, I wasn't limping anymore—walking, climbing stairs, pain-free. I finally felt like my body was mine again.</p>",
        "gzoNOfWvxkEJP_text": "<p>Carolyn, 55</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-583937727340151619"
    },
    "gp_section_583937727340217155": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "f1c0ad314508334b54998930f105f8fe913b68856570a50e4d6017cf8bf7b80a_1_1_0_0__1",
        "gPdLZGzkJDaih_text": "<p>Axis #1: Hormone Harmony </p>",
        "gVoJlYyNRyEBd_text": "<p>Axis #3: Gut &amp; Nutrient Support</p>",
        "gWvjqFycZeolt_text": "<p><strong>Turmeric + Moringa&nbsp;</strong></p><p>→ Quells the hidden fire in your tendons, stopping further collagen loss and soothing sharp pain fast.</p>",
        "gcUJtTYRUzCTz_text": "<p><strong>DIM + Black Cohosh</strong></p><p>→ Restores estrogen so your body can restart collagen production (“turns repair back on”).</p>",
        "gg2N1CKfa0u_text": "<p>Here’s why single‑ingredient supplements fall short—and how MenoMate™ tackles <strong>all three</strong> root causes at once:</p>",
        "gg9l8Yabivf_text": "<p>2 capsules each morning. Thousands of women over 50 have already found relief—and you can too.</p>",
        "ggFr1c3Q0_r_text": "<p>🔒 90‑Day “Wake‑Up Pain‑Free” Guarantee</p>",
        "ggJfwgzkS31_text": "<p>Imagine rebuilding a house while it’s on fire, with blocked supply lines, and no crew—impossible. MenoMate™ succeeds because it:</p><p>✓ Restores your hormonal “crew” to rebuild collagen</p><p>✓ Puts out the inflammatory fire so repairs hold</p><p>✓ Clears the gut “roads” so nutrients reach your hips</p>",
        "ggTno9YwrbB_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "ggU4wnNqtoF_text": "<strong>Why This Matters</strong>",
        "ggdFxaLNv84_text": "<strong>Simple Routine:</strong>",
        "ggt_8_xdRLB_text": "&nbsp;Introduce MenoMate <span style=\"color:#9128B4;\">The 3‑Axis Breakthrough</span>: Rebuild, Relieve, Renew",
        "guWDNgLGfqtcY_text": "<p>Axis #2: Inflammation Rescue</p>",
        "gutRBpVZekmCl_text": "<p><strong>Probiotics + Inulin&nbsp;</strong></p><p>→ Heals gut lining to break the pain cycle and ensures you absorb every collagen‑building nutrient.</p>"
