        "ggoBTEkmIoL_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">For best results, take <strong>2 capsules each morning</strong> before breakfast with a glass of water.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:px;\">If you’ve recently completed a course of antibiotics or feel you need extra digestive and hormonal support, you may take up to <strong>4 capsules daily</strong>.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "ggq9d_wn-sw_text": "<p>Yes! We ship MenoMate worldwide — no matter where you are, we’ll deliver straight to your door. Enjoy <strong>free shipping</strong> on all orders over $70. For orders under this amount, shipping fees are based on your location and will be automatically calculated at checkout after you enter your delivery address.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "ggrqp3j-QXa_text": "<p>Yes! Your payment details are protected with <strong>bank-level encryption (SSL)</strong> and <strong>PCI-DSS compliance</strong> (the highest security standard). We never store or access your full credit card information—your data stays safe at every step.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_0": "<p>Are Wellness Nest supplements <strong>FDA-approved</strong>?</p>",
