        "ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_6": "<p>How big are the capsules?</p>",
        "ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_7": "<p>Do I have to keep MenoMate in the fridge?</p>",
        "ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_8": "<p>Where are Wellness Nest supplements <strong>manufactured</strong>?</p>",
        "ggsLdKcTrct_childItem_9": "<p>What if MenoMate doesn't work?</p>",
        "ggtGrKuEAUB_text": "Here Are The Top Questions We Get About MenoMate",
        "ggu8mgAIWod_text": "<p>MenoMate is made with natural, high-quality ingredients and is generally considered safe for pregnant and breastfeeding women.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, because every pregnancy and postpartum journey is unique, we strongly recommend consulting your doctor before starting.</p>",
        "ggvCmQcIgkZ_text": "<p>MenoMate is made with natural, high-quality ingredients and does not contain estrogen or synthetic hormones.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However, for your safety, we strongly advise <strong>discussing MenoMate with your oncologist or healthcare provider</strong> before starting, so they can assess whether it is appropriate for your situation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your health journey deserves personalized care, and we’re here to support you however we can. If you’d like to share more details or ask questions privately, our Customer Service Team is always ready to listen: support@wellnessnest.co.</p>",
        "ggwjTaW5t1z_text": "<p>MenoMate is <strong>100% caffeine-free and stimulant-free</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It’s made with natural, high-quality ingredients, and every component is clearly listed on our packaging and website for full transparency. This makes it safe for daily use, allowing women to enjoy long-term benefits without the jittery effects associated with stimulants.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_0": "<p>When can I experience results from MenoMate?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_1": "<p>I am on a diet (e.g., <strong>Vegan / Ketogenic / Paleo / Kosher</strong>). Can I still take MenoMate?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_2": "<p>Does MenoMate contain <strong>gluten, soy, peanuts, dairy, shellfish</strong> or other common allergens for women?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_3": "<p>I am on <strong>medication</strong> or have existing health conditions. Can I still take MenoMate?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_4": "<p>Is it safe to take if I'm <strong>pregnant / breastfeeding</strong>?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_5": "<p>I have had <strong>estrogen-receptor–positive (ER+) breast cancer</strong>. Can I take MenoMate?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_6": "<p>Can <strong>men</strong> take MenoMate?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_7": "<p>Does MenoMate have any <strong>side effects?</strong></p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_8": "<p>Does MenoMate contain <strong>caffeine</strong> or any other stimulants?</p>",
        "ggx4m4JT0f-_childItem_9": "<p>Is there an <strong>age</strong> restriction?</p>",
        "ggyq55hpJXo_text": "<p>No, MenoMate is free from these and other common allergens such as tree nuts, eggs, and sesame. It’s also vegan-friendly and suitable for a variety of diets, including keto, paleo, and kosher.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#gGtENbNCoM\"><span style=\"color:#6D2D88;\"><u>Click Here To Choose Your Bottles Now</u></span></a></p>"
